OL,3,AThomas Markle charged in US for
OL,4,Apossessing child sex abuse images
OL,5,
OL,6,FThomas Markle, the father of Meghan,
OL,7,FDuchess of Sussex has been charged by a
OL,8,Ffederal grand jury in Los Angeles with
OL,9,Fpossessing child sex abuse images.
OL,11,FMarkle, who remains in custody in
OL,12,FFlorida, allegedly possessed materials
OL,13,Fthat include at least one image
OL,14,Finvolving a prepubescent minor and a
OL,15,Fminor under 12 years old, court
OL,16,Fdocuments filed in California show.
OL,18,FThe 82-year-old has denied possessing
OL,19,Fimages of child sex abuse.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
